<title>POLAND: RELPOL JULY GROUP NET UP TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>RELPOL JULY GROUP NET UP TO PLN 0.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY			    1997     1996</p>
<p> group net profit	     0.82 vs   0.46</p>
<p> group pre-tax profit	 1.34 vs   0.53</p>
<p> group operating profit     1.38 vs   0.52</p>
<p> group sales		    7.33 vs   3.32</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY		    1997     1996</p>
<p> group net profit	     5.86 vs   3.35</p>
<p> group pre-tax profit	10.06 vs   4.85</p>
<p> group operating profit     7.28 vs   3.72</p>
<p> group sales		   52.63 vs  23.33</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish electromagnetic transmitter</p>
<p>maker is Relpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
